8️⃣ Buff & Debuff Value Formula
8.1 Buff Power
BuffValue =
(StatIncrease × Duration × TargetCount)
× ContextMultiplier
PvE example:

+20% Damage for 10s to 5 players
= 0.20 × 10 × 5 = 10 PU
PvP example:

+20% Damage for 10s → capped to +8%
8.2 Debuff / CC Value
CCValue =
(BaseDuration × ControlWeight)
× DRMultiplier
× TargetImportance
PvP DR example:

DRMultiplier = 1.0 → 0.5 → 0.25 → 0
9️⃣ Boss & Enemy Scaling Formula
9.1 Boss HP Scaling
BossHP =
BaseHP
× (1 + LevelDiff × 0.18)
× PartySizeMultiplier
× DifficultyMultiplier
Party scaling:

PartyMult = 1 + (Players - 1) × 0.65
9.2 Boss Damage Scaling
BossDamage =
BaseDamage
× (1 + LevelDiff × 0.12)
× DifficultyMultiplier
Damage scales slower than HP (critical MMO rule).

🔟 Encounter Power Budget (Very Important)
Each encounter has a Power Budget (PB).

EncounterPB =
Σ(PlayerEffectivePower) × DifficultyFactor
Boss abilities must not exceed PB unless:

Telegraph > 1.5s
Counterplay exists
Limited frequency
